ly", "sig": "or a passport"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 164.6667, "b": 165.3667, "txt": "no star", "big": 1}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 185.1667, "b": 188.7667, "txt": "Look at your license tonight. Find the star.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 268.9333, "b": 270.3667, "kan": "$45", "rom": "without the right ID", "sig": "not refundable · good 10 days", "lado": "izq"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 342.8, "b": 346.4, "txt": "Have a passport? Bring the passport.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 406.1, "b": 412.5333, "txt": "Read the ticket and the ID out loud, letter by letter.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 413.6, "b": 414.6, "txt": "not Carl"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 476.8, "b": 481.8667, "txt": "Slip-ons or sneakers. No metal.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 553.4, "b": 562.5667, "txt": "Say: I'm seventy-seven, what would you like me to do?", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 598.5667, "b": 602.8667, "txt": "Bring the plastic ID every time.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 657.0333, "b": 660.2333, "kan": "Jan 27, 2026", "rom": "assigned seats", "sig": "pick them when you buy"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 681.7333, "b": 691.4333, "txt": "Pick your seats together when you buy.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 834.2, "b": 838.6667, "txt": "At the gate: I'll need to preboard, please.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 926.3333, "b": 927.3667, "txt": "in cash", "big": 1}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 939.4, "b": 946.2333, "kan": "7 days", "rom": "refund to a credit card", "sig": "20 days any other way", "lado": "izq"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 977.4333, "b": 983.4667, "txt": "Say: I'd like my refund to my original form of payment.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 1083.2, "b": 1088.8333, "kan": "855-787-2227", "rom": "TSA Cares", "sig": "call 72 hours before"}, {"k": "Kin", "a": 1101.3, "b": 1102.0333, "txt": "titanium"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 1126.5, "b": 1130.1, "txt": "Tell the officer about your new knee first.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Palabra", "a": 1159.3667, "b": 1161.3333, "kan": "10–15 min", "rom": "before departure", "sig": "the boarding door closes", "lado": "izq"}, {"k": "Prueba", "a": 1197.7, "b": 1201.7333, "txt": "Security first. Coffee after.", "lab": "linda's rule"}, {"k": "Cta", "a": 1560.4, "b": 1565.9333, "txt": "Did you know about the $45 fee?"}, {"k": "Cta", "a": 1566.2333, "b": 1570.8333, "txt": "Does your license have the star?"}, {"k": "Fin", "a": 1587.9333, "b": 1590.1333, "sub": "fly safe, my friends"}]}